    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/merch-my-day-gmbh/controller-kalkulation-business-performance-bielefeld-193678> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-controllerin-senior-mit-schwerpunkt-business-enablement-in-bonn-197739> a prov:Entity,
