    schema:description "<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Harbor Labs</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;is a new team within Harbor focused on solving hard AI implementation problems in the legal market. We have strong hypotheses about what works, but&nbsp;we're&nbsp;building this like a startup: learning as we go, adjusting direction based on what the market tells us, and staying flexible about how we&nbsp;operate.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We're&nbsp;looking for a&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Director of AI Engagements&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">to lead our most important client relationships and&nbsp;set&nbsp;the strategy for how we deploy AI in production. This is a senior role for someone who can sit across the table from a GC or COO, shape the direction of an engagement, and then roll up their sleeves and build alongside the team to deliver it.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">This is a leadership role, but not a hands-off one.&nbsp;You'll&nbsp;own the strategy for your engagements and stay close enough to the work to configure systems, pressure-test outputs, and make the calls that&nbsp;determine&nbsp;whether AI&nbsp;actually sticks&nbsp;in a&nbsp;client's&nbsp;day-to-day.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <hr> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">What Makes This Different:</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:280,&quot;335559739&quot;:120}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Our edge is combining deep legal domain experience with product sensibility and strong engineering. We understand how legal teams&nbsp;actually work, what change management looks like in risk-averse environments, and how to build software that people will use. We also know the common pitfalls of enterprise software in traditionally low-innovation areas like law, and&nbsp;we're&nbsp;determined&nbsp;to avoid them.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We focus on hard, novel problems where standard platforms fall short. The work is&nbsp;ambiguous,&nbsp;the solutions&nbsp;aren't&nbsp;obvious, and&nbsp;that's&nbsp;the point. As a senior leader here, you&nbsp;set&nbsp;the bar for how we approach those problems and how we show up with clients.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <h4><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">What You'll Do:</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:280,&quot;335559739&quot;:120}\">&nbsp;</span></h4> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Own the strategy for your engagements.&nbsp;Shape what success looks like with the client's leadership, define the roadmap, and make&nbsp;the prioritization&nbsp;calls.&nbsp;You're&nbsp;accountable for the outcome and the relationship, not just the deliverable.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Lead at the executive level.&nbsp;Be the trusted partner to GCs, COOs, and heads of legal operations. Translate where AI is heading into a concrete plan they can get&nbsp;behind, and&nbsp;bring skeptics along.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Stay hands-on with the work.&nbsp;Configure systems, structure knowledge sources, write and refine prompts, design test cases, and&nbsp;validate&nbsp;outputs against real data. You lead from inside the work, not above it.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Set&nbsp;direction&nbsp;for delivery.&nbsp;Define how an engagement is scoped, staffed, and sequenced. Work shoulder-to-shoulder with engineers and delivery leads to&nbsp;turn&nbsp;an ambiguous business problem into a production system.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Design the operating model, not just the workflow.&nbsp;Figure out how AI changes the way a legal team&nbsp;operates: the processes, the roles, the&nbsp;governance.&nbsp;Redesign how the work gets done, then make the change actually happen.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Drive architecture and integration decisions.&nbsp;Partner with engineers on how AI fits into client tech stacks: APIs, data flows,&nbsp;security&nbsp;and compliance requirements. Hold the line on what's production-grade.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Help build Harbor&nbsp;Labs itself.&nbsp;This is a ground-floor leadership opportunity.&nbsp;You'll shape how we sell, how we deliver, who we hire, and where we go next.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <h4><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">What We're Looking For:</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:280,&quot;335559739&quot;:120}\">&nbsp;</span></h4> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">You&nbsp;operate&nbsp;like an owner.&nbsp;You've&nbsp;run engagements, programs, or a function end-to-end and been accountable for the result. You set direction when there&nbsp;isn't&nbsp;one&nbsp;and you&nbsp;don't&nbsp;wait for permission to fix&nbsp;what's&nbsp;broken.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">You lead from the front, hands on the work.&nbsp;Seniority&nbsp;hasn't&nbsp;pulled you away from the details.&nbsp;You're&nbsp;as comfortable in a configuration screen or a prompt as you are in a boardroom, and you believe the two&nbsp;can't&nbsp;be separated.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">You've&nbsp;delivered&nbsp;real&nbsp;change in how teams work.&nbsp;You understand legal operations, professional services, or a comparable environment, and&nbsp;you've&nbsp;redesigned how people&nbsp;actually do&nbsp;their jobs, not just&nbsp;shipped&nbsp;a tool.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">You're&nbsp;deeply fluent in&nbsp;AI, but&nbsp;not captured by hype.&nbsp;You understand how these systems work in production: RAG architectures, agentic workflows, prompt engineering, evaluation methods. You know how to separate&nbsp;signal&nbsp;from noise when every vendor claims to be the next breakthrough.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">You hold current model-provider credentials.&nbsp;Anthropic Academy certifications (AI Fluency: Framework &amp; Foundations, Claude Code,&nbsp;Building&nbsp;with the Claude API, Model Context Protocol) are a strong plus, and current OpenAI Academy coursework counts too. We treat these as a real signal, not a checkbox: they show&nbsp;you're&nbsp;building with today's tools, not describing&nbsp;yesterday's.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">You're&nbsp;technical-adjacent&nbsp;and unafraid of it.&nbsp;You&nbsp;don't&nbsp;need to write Python all day, but you can read an API doc, reason about a system architecture, and have a credible conversation with engineers about tradeoffs.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">You command a room at any level.&nbsp;Executive presentations, working sessions with skeptical users, hard conversations about scope and risk. You build trust fast and hold it under pressure.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">You're&nbsp;relentlessly practical.&nbsp;You care about what works in production and what changes client behavior, not what sounds impressive in a deck.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">You're&nbsp;comfortable with ambiguity.&nbsp;Harbor Labs is&nbsp;new&nbsp;and the market is evolving.&nbsp;You'll&nbsp;set&nbsp;the playbook, not follow one.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Nice to Have:</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:280,&quot;335559739&quot;:120}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Senior experience in legal operations, legal technology, or a transformation/innovation function</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Track record&nbsp;leading client engagements in consulting or professional services</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Experience at a product company (product, solutions, or delivery leadership)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Hands-on experience with a broad range of AI development tools and LLM APIs</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Why Harbor Labs:</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:280,&quot;335559739&quot;:120}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We're&nbsp;a small, senior team working on hard problems with clients who are serious about deploying AI in production. The work is hands-on, the ownership is real, and the leadership you exercise here will directly shape what this team becomes.</span> <span data-contrast=\"none\">This is early.&nbsp;You'll&nbsp;have meaningful input into the strategy, the team, and what Harbor Labs grows into.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">How to Apply:</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:280,&quot;335559739&quot;:120}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Send us a note about why this role interests you and an engagement or initiative you led that&nbsp;you're&nbsp;proud of, ideally one where you&nbsp;set&nbsp;the strategy and stayed close to the work. Examples and references matter more to us than a polished resume.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><strong><span class=\"x_ContentPasted0\">About Us:</span></strong></p> <p><span class=\"x_ContentPasted0\">Harbor is the preeminent provider of expert services across strategy, legal technology, operations, and intelligence. Our globally integrated team of 900+ strategists, technologists, and specialists navigate alongside our clients – leading law firms, corporations, and their law departments – to provide essential resources and invaluable insights. Anchored in a rich heritage of deep knowledge, steadfast relationships, and mutual respect, our unwavering dedication lies in shaping the future of the legal industry and fostering enduring partnerships within our community and ecosystem.</span></p> <p><em><span class=\"x_ContentPasted0\">Harbor is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, civil union status, national origin, ancestry, age, parental status, disabled status, veteran status, or any other legally protected classification, in accordance with applicable law.</span>&nbsp;</em></p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-harborglobal ;
