    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "engineering-manager-mobile-london-manchester-71587" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-08-26"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<p><strong>Purpose of Position</strong></p> <p>We are looking for an Engineering Manager to lead Team Pegasus, responsible for the Awin Mobile App and its backend platform. Pegasus is part of the Publisher Tribe that builds the experiences publishers rely on every day: discovering opportunities, generating links, tracking performance, and growing their partnerships on the go.</p> <p>The role is focused primarily on the creator-focused mobile app. You will lead two teams that bring it to life:</p> <ul> <li><strong>Pegasus Mobile</strong>, building our Flutter-based mobile application.</li> <li><strong>Pegasus Platform</strong>, providing the APIs and backend services that power the mobile app and our publisher web experience.</li> </ul> <p>This is a leadership role, not a hands-on coding role, but we expect strong technical depth so you can guide the team and unblock delivery when needed.</p> <p><strong>Key Tasks</strong></p> <ul> <li>Coach and mentor engineers, fostering their growth and career development.</li> <li>Drive recruitment efforts and ensure successful onboarding for new team members.</li> <li>Conduct performance reviews, track individual development plans, and provide regular feedback.</li> <li>Collaborate closely with the Product Manager to define team objectives and OKRs.</li> <li>Enable the team to take ownership of the software delivery lifecycle and drive continuous improvement.</li> <li>Facilitate discussions and decision-making processes within the team, resolving conflicts when necessary.</li> <li>Coordinate with Product, UX and other engineering teams to deliver on shared goals.</li> <li>Champion AI-assisted development, code generation and agentic coding workflows to accelerate delivery across the team.</li> <li>Contribute to knowledge sharing and promote a culture of learning within the team.</li> <li>Contribute to the strategic direction of the Engineering Management group.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Skills &amp; Expertise</strong></p> <p><strong>Required:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Minimum 2 years of experience as an Engineering Manager, Technical Lead or equivalent leadership position, with a clear servant-leadership and empowering management style.</li> <li>Deep, hands-on experience building and shipping mobile applications in a commercial setting, ideally apps you have helped launch and scale.</li> <li>Strong product mindset, comfortable collaborating with Product and UX on discovery and shaping outcomes, not just executing requirements.</li> <li>Backend and cloud literacy sufficient to lead the Platform team (backend, API, AWS).</li> <li>Hands-on experience with AI-assisted development, code generation and agentic coding workflows to accelerate delivery.</li> <li>Strong communicator across technical and non-technical audiences, comfortable adopting language based on the room.</li> <li>Comfortable working in an Agile setup (Scrum or Kanban), facilitating ceremonies and supporting the team through change.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Nice to Have</strong></p> <ul> <li>Hands-on experience with Flutter.</li> <li>Product experience in the creator economy, for example creator tooling, affiliate or creator monetisation platforms, or influencer-facing products.</li> <li>Experience orchestrating multi-agent AI workflows for engineering or product use cases.</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\"><strong>Our Offer</strong></div> <ul class=\"RichTextList-bulleted\"> <li> <div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\"><strong>Flexi-Week</strong>: We prioritise your mental health and wellbeing by offering you a four-day Flexi-Week (with one lighter or completely disconnected day per week) at full pay, with no reduction to your annual holiday allowance.</div> </li> <li> <div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\"><strong>Flexi-office</strong>: We offer an international culture and flexibility through our hybrid/remote working scheme which is designed to foster a culture of mutual trust and working flexibility.</div> </li> <li> <div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\"><strong>Work Expense Contribution &amp; Remote Working Furniture</strong>: You will receive a monthly allowance to cover part of your running costs, as well as a furniture package to support you in setting up a comfortable workspace when working from home.</div> </li> <li> <div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\"><strong>Health and Wellbeing</strong>: With our support and access to various initiatives and sports offers, you can focus on your mental and physical wellbeing.</div> </li> <li> <div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\"><strong>Development</strong>: We’ve built our extensive training suite, Awin Academy, to cover a wide range of skills that support your professional and personal growth, with trainings conveniently packaged to help your overall development.</div> </li> <li> <div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\"><strong>Appreciation</strong>: Thank and reward colleagues by sending them a voucher through our peer-to-peer recognition programme.</div> </li> </ul> <div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\"><em>We are hiring in multiple countries for this role. Additional benefits, including health and wellbeing offerings, will be discussed during the initial interview.</em></div> <p>Established in 2000, Awin is proud of our dynamic, social and inclusive culture.</p> <p>Like all businesses, we’ve had to adapt and nurture our culture in a virtual environment. Our virtual ‘Life @ Awin’ hub brings our colleagues from across the globe together for various social activities.</p> <p>Diversity &amp; Inclusion are paramount to us, and we proudly pursue and hire diverse team members. We champion uniqueness and authenticity; this is who we are at our core. Our network of affiliate partnerships are diverse and transparent, as are the employees powering our vision to build the world’s leading open partner ecosystem. We welcome all backgrounds, identities, and experiences. If you need support at any point in the application or interview process, please let us know.</p> <p><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0\">Awin is part of the Axel Springer group.</span></span> <span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0\">Learn more at&nbsp;</span></span><a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW55218471 BCX0\" href=\"https://www.axelspringer.com/en/\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"TextRun Highlight Underlined SCXW55218471 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">axelspringer.com/</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">en</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">/</span></span></a><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0\">, and explore the Axel Springer Essentials here:</span></span> <a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW55218471 BCX0\" href=\"https://www.axelspringer.com/en/inside/the-essentials-what-we-have-adapted-and-why\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"TextRun Highlight Underlined SCXW55218471 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">axelspringer.com/en/inside/the-essentials-what-we-have-adapted-and-why</span></span></a><span class=\"TextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW55218471 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p>Apply now to begin the next stage of your career at a progressive company that supports both your professional and personal development.</p> <p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">#LI-RS1</span></p> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
