    schema:datePosted "2026-08-25"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p>At Anaplan, we are a team of innovators focused on optimizing business decision-making through our leading AI-infused scenario planning and analysis platform so our customers can outpace their competition and the market.</p> <p>What unites Anaplanners across teams and geographies is our collective commitment to our customers’ success and to our Winning Culture.</p> <p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Our customers rank among the who’s who in the Fortune 50. Coca-Cola, LinkedIn, Adobe, LVMH and Bayer are just a few of the 2,400+ global companies who rely on our best-in-class platform.</p> <p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Our Winning Culture is the engine that drives our teams of innovators. We champion diversity of thought and ideas, we behave like leaders regardless of title, we are committed to achieving ambitious goals, and we love celebrating<em> </em>our wins – big and small.</p> <p>Supported by operating principles of being strategy-led, <a href=\"https://www.anaplan.com/careers/\">values</a>-based and disciplined in execution, you’ll be inspired, connected, developed and rewarded here. Everything that makes you unique is welcome; join us and let’s build what’s next - together!</p></div><p>Anaplan has an exciting opportunity for an <strong>Engineering Manager</strong> to lead the <strong>Environment Tooling</strong> team within Platform Engineering, and at the forefront of our ongoing DevOps and Platform transformation.</p> <p>The Environment Tooling team is a cornerstone of our Platform Engineering organisation. They own and maintain our core GitOps deployment pipeline and drive developer experience tooling. Looking forward, the Environment Tooling team will expand its scope to lead our Next-Generation Environment Strategy - taking named ownership of our non-production environments and building automated orchestration and self-healing systems for the path to production.</p> <p>As the manager of the Environment Tooling team, your passion will be coaching and building a talented team of platform engineers while balancing mission-critical operational stability with bold, strategic initiatives. You will lead a team of six engineers and report to the Senior Director, Platform Engineering.</p> <p>You will join a collaborative engineering community that embraces diverse perspectives, isn't afraid to push boundaries, and is passionate about helping our customers and each other succeed.</p> <h2>Your impact:</h2> <h3>Leadership &amp; People Management</h3> <ul> <li><strong>Coaching &amp; Talent Development:</strong> Lead, mentor, and grow a team of high-performing platform engineers, ensuring individual career development, clear goals, and continuous skill building.</li> <li><strong>Team Wellbeing &amp; Culture:</strong> Foster a safe, inclusive, and motivated team culture. Prioritise healthy work-life balance and operational readiness.</li> <li><strong>Agile &amp; Process Execution:</strong> Embrace a pragmatic Agile mindset to continuously refine team processes, manage sprint commitments, remove blockers, and deliver value iteratively.</li> <li><strong>Cross-Functional Collaboration:</strong> Partner closely with peer platform managers, security, and software development leaders to align on roadmaps, boundaries, and shared goals.</li> <li><strong>Project &amp; Initiative Delivery:</strong> Own end-to-end delivery of Environment Tooling initiatives, from scoping and planning through sequencing dependencies, tracking milestones, managing risk, and reporting progress to stakeholders.</li> </ul> <h3>Platform Ownership &amp; Operations</h3> <ul> <li><strong>Argo CD &amp; GitOps Core:</strong> Lead the active engineering ownership, architectural hardening, scalability, and operational support for Argo CD across the entire platform.</li> <li><strong>Feature Flagging Infrastructure:</strong> Govern platform-wide feature flagging tools and setting the technology strategy.</li> <li><strong>Operational Readiness &amp; On-Call:</strong> Direct the team's dedicated on-call rotation to ensure deployment pipeline stability and smooth release execution during critical downtime windows.</li> </ul> <h3>Strategic Vision: Next-Generation Environments &amp; Non-Prod Ownership</h3> <ul> <li><strong>Named Non-Prod Ownership:</strong> Establish the Environment Tooling team as the owner, guardian, and governance authority for all non-production environments across the path to production.</li> <li><strong>Local Development:</strong> Provide and support modern developer environments, such as local Tilt workflows on developer laptops backed by cloud-hosted services.</li> <li><strong>Environment Orchestration &amp; Tooling Development:</strong> Design and build overarching orchestration systems and new platform tooling to tear down and rebuild non-prod environments on demand. This includes:</li> <li><strong>Building New Core Capabilities:</strong> Architect and develop new internal tooling to automatically generate mock test data, manage environment test states, and provision test user identities.</li> <li><strong>Integrating Platform Pipelines:</strong> Connect orchestration workflows with infrastructure automation systems (for cluster provisioning and teardown) and service hydration pipelines.</li> <li><strong>Automated Self-Healing &amp; Guardrails:</strong> Implement automated tooling to instantly detect when a deployment breaks a non-prod environment and execute an immediate rollback.</li> <li><strong>Environment Governance:</strong> Define and enforce standards and usage policies for non-production environments across all engineering teams.</li> </ul> <h2><strong>Your skills:</strong></h2> <ul> <li><strong>Engineering Leadership:</strong> Demonstrated experience leading platform, infrastructure, or DevOps engineering teams as a manager or senior tech lead with a track record of mentoring engineers and driving key technical decisions. (First-time managers with strong aptitude and relevant lead experience are encouraged to apply)</li> <li><strong>Platform &amp; GitOps Expertise:</strong> Deep technical understanding of modern cloud-native architectures, GitOps workflows (Argo CD), Infrastructure as Code, and container orchestration.</li> <li><strong>Pragmatic &amp; Iterative Mindset:</strong> Strong commitment to delivering value early and often, prioritising continuous improvement over single-burst perfectionism.</li> <li><strong>Developer Experience Focus:</strong> Passion for simplifying the developer inner loop and building frictionless, self-service platform tooling.</li> <li><strong>Clear Communicator:</strong> Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, capable of setting clear expectations, maintaining roadmap transparency, and establishing technical governance.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Technologies that the team works with:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Deployment &amp; GitOps:</strong> Argo CD</li> <li><strong>Feature Flagging:</strong> LaunchDarkly</li> <li><strong>Developer Tooling:</strong> Tilt</li> <li><strong>Infrastructure &amp; Orchestration:</strong> Kubernetes (EKS / GKE), Docker, Terraform, Helm, Kubernetes Operators</li> <li><strong>Internal Automation &amp; Pipelines:</strong> Infrastructure Automation, Service Hydration Pipelines</li> <li><strong>Cloud Platforms:</strong> AWS, GCP</li> <li><strong>Languages:</strong> Go, Java</li> </ul><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><strong>Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) </strong></p> <p>We believe attracting and retaining the best talent and fostering an inclusive culture strengthens our business. DEIB improves our workforce, enhances trust with our partners and customers, and drives business success. Build your career in a place where diversity, equity, inclusion and belonging aren’t just words on paper – this is what drives our innovation, it’s how we connect, and it contributes to what makes us a market leader. We believe in a hiring and working environment where all people are respected and valued, regardless of gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, ethnicity, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, or any other aspect which makes people unique. We hire you for who you are, and we want you to bring your authentic self to work every day! </p> <p>We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive equitable benefits and all privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation. &nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Fraud Recruitment Disclaimer</strong> &nbsp;</p> <p>It has come to our attention that fraudulent and fictitious job opportunities are being circulated on the Internet. Prospective candidates are being contacted by certain individuals, mainly through telephone calls, emails and correspondence, claiming they are representatives of Anaplan. The main purpose of these correspondences and announcements is to obtain privileged information from individuals. </p> <p>Anaplan does not: &nbsp;</p> <ul> <li>Extend offers to candidates without an extensive interview process with a member of our recruitment team and a hiring manager via video or in person. &nbsp;</li> <li>Send job offers via email. All offers are first extended verbally by a member of our internal recruitment team whenever possible and then followed up via written communication. &nbsp;</li> </ul> <p>All emails from Anaplan would come from an ----- email address. Should you have any doubts about the authenticity of an email, letter or telephone communication purportedly from, for, or on behalf of Anaplan, please send an email to ----- before taking any further action in relation to the correspondence. &nbsp;</p> <p><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">C</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">andidate data processed during our recruitment activities is handled </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">in accordance with</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\"> our Candidate Privacy Notice. This may include the use of artificial intelligence or automated tools to </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">assist</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\"> our team in evaluating qualifications.</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p></div> Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
