    schema:title "Head of Scaled, Ads Solutions" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/openai/head-of-scaled-ads-solutions-london-168449> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-industrial-controls-engineer-munich-352892> a prov:Entity,
