    schema:title "Manager, Forward Deployed Engineering" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/parloa/manager-forward-deployed-engineering-433653> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-manufacturing-engineer-munich-258804> a prov:Entity,
