<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-nail-tech-content-creator-berlin-476927> a prov:Entity,
        schema:JobPosting ;
    dcterms:source <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/source/arbeitnow> ;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-08-26T04:45:30+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/nailscamp-gmbh/nail-tech-content-creator-berlin-476927> ;
    kgjobs:active true ;
    kgjobs:canonicalFingerprint "fbfeed54896255918d2b2efb3001c7648b78bec7d2dc5387efdb546d90b5f864" ;
    kgjobs:classification "not_match" ;
    kgjobs:firstSeenAt "2026-08-25T18:45:43+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:lastSeenAt "2026-08-26T04:45:30+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "nail-tech-content-creator-berlin-476927" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-08-25"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "Your nails. Your creativity. Your camera. Are you a passionate Nail Tech who knows the difference between Builder Gel and Polyacryl, can execute a flawless Russian Manicure, and gets excited about creating the perfect Nail Art? And do you also love creating content, explaining techniques, filming tutorials and showing your personality on camera? Then we want to hear from you. We are looking for a Nail Tech & Content Creator to join our team and become one of the faces and technical experts behind our nail content. You won't just create beautiful nails. You'll show our community how to create them. Aufgaben Your responsibilities 💅 Nail Tech Expertise You will be our technical nail expert, creating professional nail looks and demonstrating our products across different techniques and levels of expertise. Your work will include: Classic Gel Polish / gel manicure Soft Gel Nail Tips / Full Cover Tips Builder Gel / BIAB Polyacryl / Polygel Acrylic Popits / Dual Forms Russian Manicure – this is particularly important to us Nail extensions and refills Nail Art and creative techniques Professional nail preparation Different nail shapes and structures Clean, precise and technically correct application 🎥 Content Creation You will create engaging content for Instagram, TikTok and other social platforms. This includes: Short-form videos and Reels Full step-by-step tutorials Educational content Product demonstrations Nail transformations Nail Art content Trend-based content Tips, tricks and professional techniques Before & after content You won't just demonstrate a technique – you'll explain it clearly and make people want to try it themselves. 🎬 Be the face of our content You are comfortable being on camera and showing your personality. You don't need to be a professional presenter. Authenticity, personality and confidence are more important to us. 💡 Content & Product Development You will work closely with our Marketing and Product teams to: Develop new content formats Test and review products Provide professional technical feedback Identify new nail trends Create new nail looks Turn customer questions and trends into useful content Qualifikation What we're looking for Nail expertise You have strong professional Nail Tech skills and are comfortable working across multiple techniques. Russian Manicure is particularly important for this position. You have a strong understanding of nail preparation, product application, structure, shaping and overall nail health. Most importantly, you have high technical standards and an eye for detail. Experience with video editing is a plus, but you don't need to be a professional videographer. Personality You are creative, curious, reliable and hands-on. You enjoy experimenting with new techniques and trends, but you also care about technical quality. You're someone who can look at a nail trend and think: \"I know exactly how we could make this into great content.\" Benefits What we offer A creative role combining Nail Tech expertise, Content Creation and Social Media The opportunity to become one of the faces of our brand Lots of creative freedom and the opportunity to develop your own content ideas Collaboration with our Marketing, Social Media and Product teams A dynamic and international environment Opportunities to develop both your technical and content skills Access to new products and nail trends A growing European beauty brand and an engaged nail community Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-nailscamp-gmbh ;
    schema:identifier "arbeitnow-nail-tech-content-creator-berlin-476927" ;
