            schema:name "Berlin , Berlin, Germany" ] ;
    schema:title "Praktikant*in Brand & Product Marketing (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/amperecloud-gmbh/praktikantin-brand-product-marketing-berlin-301113> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-praktikantin-business-transformation-grafenau-51978> a prov:Entity,
