    schema:description "Why The Mobility House? Help shape our vision of an emission-free energy and mobility future High levelof responsibility and rapid development in a growing and innovative company Open, diverse & international team Flexible working hours and additional vacation days In the event ofa child's illness, you are entitled to up to 15 days per year with full continued payment of wages Mobile working from home and 20 days in other European countries Choice between the latest Apple and Dell IT equipment Subsidy for Deutschlandticket job Wellpass membership Lease of your preferred car and bike via FINN or JobRad Modern office with good public transport connections and much more! What you do As Product Manager Home Energy Solution (B2C/B2B), you are responsible for our smart charging product and our home energy solution over the whole product lifecycle You design, create, launch and operate products based on our existing and newly developed technology and the experience we gathered You talk to customers to uncover their needs and shape solutions they love You define the product strategy to increase the addressable market and to potentially bringthe product to further countries You ensure that all launch activities are tackled and transparently shared with partners and internally You work together with home energy management partners to ensure seamless integration with a first focus on Germany You work closely together with our technology, energy supply and hardware team to ensure a smooth end-to-end user experience You align frequently with internal and external stakeholders and are the first contact person for eyond and our Home Energy Solutions You monitor financial performance of your products and adapt roadmaps and planning accordingly You are constantly monitoring the market, regulatory changes, competition and trends in the E-Mobility and Energy Sector and derive consequences for the development of our products Who you are You have at least three years of experience as a Product Manager or Product Owner. You worked in the energy industry in the past, preferablyas product manager for a B2C energy product You already gathered experience in the home energy management, energy or electric mobility sector. You are excited to work in a rapidly changing environment and to create a new products from the scratch You can keep the big picture in mind and manage conflicting interests accordingly. You excel when working with internal and external stakeholders. You are a team player, enjoy working in cross-functional teams and have a hands-on mentality. You speak German & English fluently Are you a good fit for us? Diversity enriches our team and makes us stronger. Regardless of origin, gender, age, sexual orientation, religion, or any disability – everyone is welcome here! We look forward to receiving your application and achieving great things together. Your contact ----- Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
