    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">About THG</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Our portfolio of</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><p><strong>Life at THG Beauty&nbsp;</strong></p> <p>We know that beauty isn’t one-size-fits-all. Our portfolio of leading retailers and iconic beauty brands caters to everyone, everywhere, empowering customers all over the world to look and feel fantastic.</p> <p>By combining our portfolio of owned brands inclusive of ESPA, Ameliorate and Christophe Robin,&nbsp;with a marketplace for over 1,300 third-party beauty brands through online retail sites LOOKFANTASTIC, Cult Beauty, and Dermstore, THG Beauty's ambition is to be the global digital partner of choice across the beauty industry, supporting the channel shift to online.</p> <p>THG Beauty’s breadth of relationships is unique to the beauty market; it engages with brands as a retailer, a brand owner, and a product developer and manufacturer, making it the industry’s digital strategic leader.&nbsp;</p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Why be a Senior Ecommerce Executive at THG Beauty?</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><em>Operates at a more senior level than Ecommerce Executive, owning relationships and providing direction. Thorough skills across data analysis, SQL and manipulating data. Understands the 'why' behind actions, not just the fact we are actioning them.</em></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">As </span><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> Senior Ecommerce Executive</span></em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;you’ll:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li>Systems: lead training and learning on TeePee, Superset, Tableau, ContentSquare, Campaign Manager and GA; manipulate SQL independently.</li> <li>Offers: independently set up all offer types; act as a point of contact for other team members requiring support.</li> <li>KPIs: proactively suggest and take actions to influence Revenue, GP, AOV, CVR &amp; Traffic.</li> <li>Site Execution: set an example in the use of systems to understand and enhance the customer journey from a trade perspective; competently use CSQ (Zoning, Journey, Workspace analysis).</li> <li>GP: own the 'why' behind trade actions; drive GP-focused decisions with greater autonomy.</li> <li>Cross channel/function collaboration: drive trading actions with greater autonomy. Ownership of multiple categories/channels.</li> <li>Change Management: understand business needs and priorities; help lead the redistribution of workload across the team to hit deadlines.</li> <li>Ownerships: thorough understanding of individual and team roles; drive own areas and support others with theirs.</li> <li>Knowledge Sharing: set an example in how knowledge and insight is shared across and outside the team<span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What skills and experience do I need for this role?</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li>Prioritisation: independently prioritise workload; support team members to do the same.</li> <li>Organisation: independently manage own workload; support others to organise theirs.</li> <li>Collaboration: lead collaboration across and outside the team; drive process improvements.</li> <li>Communication: strong written/verbal communication, flexed for the audience and division.</li> <li>Active Listening: lead by example in meetings.</li> <li>Growth Mindset: proactively identify and close gaps in own knowledge.</li> <li>Accountability: strong attention to detail in own work.</li> <li>Role Model: demonstrate leadership across the Executive level within the team.</li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What’s in it for me?</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Career Development</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"18\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Access bespoke development programmes that have been designed and developed by our in-house L&amp;D team.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;