            schema:name "London" ] ;
    schema:title "Technical Artist" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/spaitial/technical-artist-london-244697> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-technical-product-manager-all-gender-berlin-16833> a prov:Entity,
